      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNDER ANESTHETIC (1) was strongly supported last start but missed the frame when fourth (29.90), beaten 5 lengths. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. HERE WE GO (2) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 515m behind Impress Moana (30.03) in a Grade 4/5. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Has ability and can atone. FASCINATE MARIA (4) was game in defeat at the latest run, finishing second and beaten 0.8 lengths (29.94) behind Kaelix Nitro at this track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Leading player again. JUST US BOYS (5) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
